'' TWO UDTs WHOSE ONLY CAST IS 'byref as zstring' COMPARE AS STRINGS. tiko compared the objects
'' with icmp and clang refused the module. Expected output is fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target win64-msvc tests/codegen/src/udt-zstr-compare.bas -o tests/codegen/udtzstrcompare.exe
